ic financial modelling"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"3-statement financial analysis model"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a listed company and analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Income Statement","Balance Sheet","Cash Flow","Ratios","Trends","Management insights"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Financial Modelling + FP&A"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical analyst-level capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Financial modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue forecasting"},{"text":"Cost forecasting"},{"text":"EBITDA forecasting"},{"text":"Working-capital forecasting"},{"text":"Capex"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Free cash flow"},{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Variance analysis"},{"text":"Scenario planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Time value of money"},{"text":"NPV"},{"text":"IRR"},{"text":"WACC"},{"text":"Cost of debt"},{"text":"Cost of equity"},{"text":"Capital structure"},{"text":"Capital budgeting"},{"text":"Enterprise value"},{"text":"Equity value"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Valuation basics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"DCF"},{"type":"flow","items":["Revenue","EBITDA","EBIT","Taxes","FCF","WACC","Terminal Value","Enterprise Value"]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Comparable companies"},{"text":"EV/EBITDA"},{"text":"P/E"},{"text":"EV/Sales"},{"text":"Price/Book"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not treat valuation multiples as standalone investment recommendations; understand the business context behind them."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Data & Business Intelligence"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern financial analyst increasingly needs data skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"tex